From ac4215418a9aab1ba1f6219e09260a670c95a697 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 13:33:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applet: don't show a bridge waiting for a port link as
 connecting

NetworkManager keeps a bridge or bond using DHCP in IP configuration
until one of its ports gets a carrier, so the widget and its tray icon
spun forever. Show that it waits for a connected port, without spinner.

BUG: 528968
